<===> error/add_mixed_case/input.scss
// Units are case-sensitive (like dart-sass): only the exact spellings
// (px, in, deg, Hz, kHz, ...) are known and convertible. LibSass used to
// convert them case-insensitively, while comparisons were case-sensitive.
a {b: 1px + 1PX}
<===> error/add_mixed_case/error-libsass
Error: 1px and 1PX have incompatible units.
  ,
4 | a {b: 1px + 1PX}
  |             ^^^
  '
  input.scss 4:13  root stylesheet
  ,
4 | a {b: 1px + 1PX}
  |       ^^^
  '
  input.scss 4:7   root stylesheet
  ,
4 | a {b: 1px + 1PX}
  |       ^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 4:7   root stylesheet
<===>
================================================================================
