<===> error/angle_upper/input.scss
// Units are case-sensitive (like dart-sass): only the exact spellings
// (px, in, deg, Hz, kHz, ...) are known and convertible. LibSass used to
// convert them case-insensitively, while comparisons were case-sensitive.
@use 'sass:math';
a {b: math.sin(90DEG)}
<===> error/angle_upper/error-libsass
Error: $number: Expected 90DEG to have an angle unit (deg, grad, rad, turn).
  ,
5 | a {b: math.sin(90DEG)}
  |                ^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 5:16  sin()
  ,
5 | a {b: math.sin(90DEG)}
  |       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 5:7   root stylesheet
